    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 161 eachs at 8.6 a day for 18.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 26 eachs at 1.5 a day for 17.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ranked alternate manufacturer is Cosette Pharmaceuticals, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
